 19:44:03", "date_gmt_iso": "2026-08-29T19:44:03+00:00", "content": "I&#039;m not sure the M3x4rt screws are needed here, as we take off and use two in the next step.", "type": "comment", "role": "visitor", "replies": [{"id": 100672, "post_id": 1108665, "parent": 99921, "user": "tlchandler", "user_id": 101297, "date": "2026-09-06 00:33:17", "date_gmt": "2026-09-05 22:33:17", "date_gmt_iso": "2026-09-05T22:33:17+00:00", "content": "Because you need four total for this step", "type": "comment", "role": "visitor", "replies": []}]}, {"id": 99759, "post_id": 1108665, "parent": 0, "user": "Mastakko", "user_id": 148408, "date": "2026-08-28 07:08:47", "date_gmt": "2026-08-28 05:08:47", "date_gmt_iso": "2026-08-28T05:08:47+00:00", "content": "is there a suggested way to clean them?", "type": "comment", "role": "visitor", "replies": []}]